                     </div>
                     <div class="grid-list-column-2">
                        <div class="list">a reference to where the date is given on the labelling,</div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
                  <p class="list">Those particulars shall be followed by a description of the storage conditions which must be observed;</p>
               </div>
