               </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-container grid-list">
               <div class="list grid-list-column-1">
                  <span>(d) </span>
               </div>
               <div class="grid-list-column-2">
                  <p class="norm">the ‘use by’ date shall be indicated on each individual prepacked portion.</p>
               </div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-left: 24pt; text-indent: -24pt">
               <p class="norm">3.<span style="word-spacing: 15pt"> </span>The date of freezing or the date of first freezing as referred to in point 6 of Annex III shall be indicated as follows:</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-container grid-list">
