            <p class="title-gr-seq-level-1" id="id-20669177-1ed7-4fbf-9783-41bb274c8a40">
               <span class="boldface">CONVERSION FACTORS</span>
            </p>
            <p class="title-gr-seq-level-1" id="id-4597d41c-76ce-427f-875a-f9d044c8d277">CONVERSION FACTORS FOR THE CALCULATION OF ENERGY</p>
            <p class="norm">The energy value to be declared shall be calculated using the following conversion factors:</p>
            <p>
               <br/>
            </p>
            <div class="centered">
               <p>
                  <br/>
               </p>
               <table width="240" border="1" cellpadding="2" cellspacing="0" class="borderOj">
                  <col width="50%"/>
                  <col width="50%"/>
                  <tbody>
                     <tr>
                        <td valign="top"  >
                           <p class="tbl-norm">—  carbohydrate (except polyols),</p>
                        </td>
                        <td valign="top"  >
                           <p class="tbl-norm">17 kJ/g — 4 kcal/g</p>
                        </td>
                     </tr>
